[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12424.63, "timestamp": "03:27:04", "text": "这里？我觉得我们没问题。我这就走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12437.15, "timestamp": "03:27:17", "text": "好了，弹药就到此为止吧。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12448.349, "timestamp": "03:27:28", "text": "这117个。是的，应该是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12452.07, "timestamp": "03:27:32", "text": "好的。呃，绷带可促进伤口愈合达 60%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12454.15, "timestamp": "03:27:34", "text": "准备好。呃，你也照做。画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12455.83, "timestamp": "03:27:35", "text": "杀戮和能量饮料。只需使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12457.99, "timestamp": "03:27:37", "text": "恢复全部生命值，提升耐力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12459.87, "timestamp": "03:27:39", "text": "哦，谢谢。非常感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12463.349, "timestamp": "03:27:43", "text": "很多。知道了。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12467.03, "timestamp": "03:27:47", "text": "我几乎不玩这个游戏。我刚刚玩了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12469.59, "timestamp": "03:27:49", "text": "因为 Discord 的那个任务，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12471.51, "timestamp": "03:27:51", "text": "某物。所以我就说，“是啊，就是这样。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12474.67, "timestamp": "03:27:54", "text": "好久不见。我直播了绝地求生，所以为什么"}]